  "description": "Born seeing ghosts, Jong-Eon grew up in a world of shadows. His grim reality flips when he pairs up for a college project with Hye-Seong, a cheerful underclassman who somehow acts as a literal human ghost repellent. Desperate for a peaceful life, Jong-eon starts following Hye-Seong everywhere to keep the spirits at bay. But when he gets caught red-handed, Jong-Eon panics and blurts out the first excuse he can think of: he’s hopelessly in love.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
